<svg viewBox="0 0 900 414" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Supply chain with obligation attachment points">
<!-- FIGURE 16.2 REQUIRED ELEMENTS
Must appear: the five supply chain layers (base model, fine-tune, adapter,
integration, deployment) in sequence, with visibility level and
obligation level marked independently at each layer, making legible that
visibility drops off well before obligation does. Entry condition: a
system reaching deployment has passed through multiple upstream layers.
Exit condition: the gap between visibility and obligation is visible at
each layer rather than only asserted in prose. Deliberately excluded: the
due diligence sequence (Figure 16.1's job). Must work in black and white.
SOURCE: original; the five-layer structure is this chapter's own
synthesis of section 16.6's argument.
AUDIT: pass 1 [x] against list, pass 2 blind [ ], rendered and viewed [x]
-->
<title>Supply chain with obligation attachment points</title>
<style>
text{font-family:'Source Sans Pro','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;}
.ttl{font-size:17px;font-weight:700;}
.cls{font-size:14px;font-weight:700;}
.bx{font-size:12.5px;font-weight:400;}
.col{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.06em;}
.sm{font-size:11px;font-weight:400;}
.em{font-size:11px;font-style:italic;}
</style>
<rect x="0" y="0" width="900" height="414" fill="#ffffff"/>
<text x="20" y="34" class="ttl" fill="#1a2230">Figure 16.2 &#183; Supply chain with obligation attachment points</text>
<rect x="20" y="62" width="156" height="44" rx="4" fill="#1a2230"/>
<text x="98.0" y="89" class="sm" font-weight="700" fill="#ffffff" text-anchor="middle">BASE MODEL</text>
<line x1="176.0" y1="84.0" x2="176.0" y2="84.0" stroke="#1a2230" stroke-width="1.8"/><polygon points="184.0,84.0 176.0,88.0 176.0,80.0" fill="#1a2230"/>
<rect x="184" y="62" width="156" height="44" rx="4" fill="#1a2230"/>
<text x="262.0" y="89" class="sm" font-weight="700" fill="#ffffff" text-anchor="middle">FINE-TUNE</text>
<line x1="340.0" y1="84.0" x2="340.0" y2="84.0" stroke="#1a2230" stroke-width="1.8"/><polygon points="348.0,84.0 340.0,88.0 340.0,80.0" fill="#1a2230"/>
<rect x="348" y="62" width="156" height="44" rx="4" fill="#1a2230"/>
<text x="426.0" y="89" class="sm" font-weight="700" fill="#ffffff" text-anchor="middle">ADAPTER</text>
<line x1="504.0" y1="84.0" x2="504.0" y2="84.0" stroke="#1a2230" stroke-width="1.8"/><polygon points="512.0,84.0 504.0,88.0 504.0,80.0" fill="#1a2230"/>
<rect x="512" y="62" width="156" height="44" rx="4" fill="#1a2230"/>
<text x="590.0" y="89" class="sm" font-weight="700" fill="#ffffff" text-anchor="middle">INTEGRATION</text>
<line x1="668.0" y1="84.0" x2="668.0" y2="84.0" stroke="#1a2230" stroke-width="1.8"/><polygon points="676.0,84.0 668.0,88.0 668.0,80.0" fill="#1a2230"/>
<rect x="676" y="62" width="156" height="44" rx="4" fill="#1a2230"/>
<text x="754.0" y="89" class="sm" font-weight="700" fill="#ffffff" text-anchor="middle">DEPLOYMENT</text>
<text x="20" y="122" class="col" fill="#46536b">VISIBILITY TO DEPLOYER</text>
<rect x="40" y="202.0" width="116" height="18.0" fill="#46536b"/>
<rect x="204" y="184.0" width="116" height="36.0" fill="#46536b"/>
<rect x="368" y="166.0" width="116" height="54.0" fill="#46536b"/>
<rect x="532" y="148.0" width="116" height="72.0" fill="#46536b"/>
<rect x="696" y="130.0" width="116" height="90.0" fill="#46536b"/>
<line x1="20" y1="220" x2="880" y2="220" stroke="#c9d1dc" stroke-width="1"/>
<text x="20" y="252" class="col" fill="#46536b">OBLIGATION FOR DEPLOYED SYSTEM'S EFFECTS</text>
<rect x="40" y="278.0" width="116" height="72.0" fill="#8a3324"/>
<rect x="204" y="278.0" width="116" height="72.0" fill="#8a3324"/>
<rect x="368" y="278.0" width="116" height="72.0" fill="#8a3324"/>
<rect x="532" y="278.0" width="116" height="72.0" fill="#8a3324"/>
<rect x="696" y="260.0" width="116" height="90.0" fill="#8a3324"/>
<line x1="20" y1="350" x2="880" y2="350" stroke="#c9d1dc" stroke-width="1"/>
<line x1="20" y1="364" x2="880" y2="364" stroke="#c9d1dc" stroke-width="1"/>
<text x="20" y="380" class="sm" fill="#46536b">Visibility drops off sharply at the layers furthest from deployment; obligation for the deployed system's</text>
<text x="20" y="398" class="sm" fill="#46536b">effects does not drop off correspondingly, which is the gap this chapter's vendor governance addresses.</text>
</svg>